OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FA student police officer has appeared
OL,7,Fin court accused of rape and kidnap.
OL,9,FMohammad Hassan, 23, is alleged to
OL,10,Fhave forced a woman, in her 20s, into
OL,11,Fa car before raping and sexually
OL,12,Fassaulting her and then driving off at
OL,13,Fspeeds of 120mph.
OL,15,FThe trainee with Greater Manchester
OL,16,FPolice was arrested after a police
OL,17,Fchase on the M62 which ended in West
OL,18,FYorkshire.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
