FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FHassan, from Hale Lane, Failsworth, in
OL,7,FOldham who was off duty at the time,
OL,8,Fstood in the dock in custody at
OL,9,FStockport Magistrates' Court, flanked
OL,10,Fby two security guards.
OL,12,FWearing a grey sweatshirt and jogging
OL,13,Fbottoms, he spoke only to confirm his
OL,14,Fname and date of birth.
OL,16,FEwan Cooper, prosecuting, told the
OL,17,Fcourt about the alleged incident on
OL,18,Fthe evening of Saturday 8 August.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FMr Cooper said: "He got out of the
OL,7,Fcar, placed his hand on her neck and
OL,8,Fbundled her into the car.
OL,10,F"He then drove with her in the car,
OL,11,Fdrove to an area of Manchester, where
OL,12,Fhe sexually assaulted and raped her
OL,13,Fand drove off at speeds of 120mph."
OL,15,FThe court heard police were alerted
OL,16,Fafter a 999 call was received shortly
OL,17,Fbefore 10.20pm in which a woman could
OL,18,Fbe heard in distress in a vehicle in
OL,19,Fthe Manchester area.
OL,26,@nD@QOUrD@AOUuD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
