OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FOfficers traced the suspect's personal
OL,7,Fvehicle which led to the arrest on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of rape, kidnap and
OL,9,Fdangerous driving.
OL,11,FHassan, who has been suspended by the
OL,12,Fforce, has been charged with oral
OL,13,Frape, kidnap, strangulation, sexual
OL,14,Fassault, theft of a mobile phone and
OL,15,Fdangerous driving.
OL,17,FNo pleas were entered by the defendant
OL,18,Fand there was no application for bail
OL,19,Fat the hearing on Tuesday, which
OL,20,Flasted just over five minutes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
