OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FDistrict Judge James Hulse, told the
OL,7,Fdefendant the rape and kidnap
OL,8,Fallegations could only be dealt with
OL,9,Fat a higher, crown court, and as the
OL,10,Fother alleged offences are linked to
OL,11,Fthose, he was remanded into custody
OL,12,Ffor a further hearing at Manchester
OL,13,FCrown Court on September 15.
OL,15,FAfter being charged, Assistant Chief
OL,16,FConstable Mark Dexter said: "GMP
OL,17,Fdetectives and staff have been working
OL,18,Fon this investigation throughout the
OL,19,Flast 48 hours to ensure charges are
OL,20,Fbrought in this case.
OL,26,@xD@]OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
