OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786483115
OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,F"The victim is our priority, and we
OL,7,Fare ensuring she continues to receive
OL,8,Fspecialist support. Criminal
OL,9,Fproceedings must now take its course
OL,10,Fwithout interference.
OL,12,F"I understand and share the feeling
OL,13,Famong the public and our thousands of
OL,14,Fhard-working, decent staff who will
OL,15,Fhave seen this news.
OL,17,F"Proceedings are under way and
OL,18,Fnecessary action will be decisively
OL,19,Ftaken within the regulations."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU{D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
