OL,3,CTrainee police officer in court
OL,4,Ccharged with rape and kidnap
OL,6,FA woman was safeguarded at the scene
OL,7,Fand continues to be supported by
OL,8,Fspecialist officers and support
OL,9,Fservices, the force said.
